# detect-secrets baseline
# Run: detect-secrets scan > .secrets.baseline
# Check: detect-secrets audit .secrets.baseline
#
# Known false positives (allowed):
# - .env.example files (placeholder values only)
# - application-test.yml (test-only keys)
# - k8s/*/secrets.yaml (placeholder templates)
#
# To install: pip install detect-secrets
# To scan: detect-secrets scan --baseline .secrets.baseline
# Pre-commit: detect-secrets-hook --baseline .secrets.baseline
